# Build-context hygiene for the Apex image. The never-bake list
# is structural, not conventional: a node's identity and its
# door material must be minted on the machine that runs it, so
# they are excluded from the context even if a working tree
# happens to carry them.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
bridge.pid
navi.llamafile
updates/
config/mesh/
config/dhd/
config/github-auth.json
FIRST-BOOT.txt
.git/
